Option Explicit

' Events of a GCV add-in. The work is done in the add-in's main module
' (AddinOpened / AddinClosing) and in GcvAddin.

Private Sub Workbook_Open()
    AddinOpened
End Sub

Private Sub Workbook_BeforeClose(Cancel As Boolean)
    AddinClosing
End Sub

Private Sub Workbook_BeforeSave(ByVal SaveAsUI As Boolean, Cancel As Boolean)
    GcvAddin.OnAddinSave
End Sub
